&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Commercial Account Executive for Southern Cone, you&#39;ll be the primary point of contact for prospective and existing small and medium-sized business and mid-market customers in Argentina, Chile, Uruguay, Paraguay and Bolivia. You&#39;ll help organizations with up to 1,999 team members modernize how they plan, build, secure, and ship software with GitLab&#39;s AI-powered DevSecOps platform. You&#39;ll own a broad book of business and act as a trusted advisor as you prospect, run complex sales cycles, guide customers toward clear business outcomes, support adoption, and reduce churn. You&#39;ll work closely with Sales Development, Customer Success, Renewals, Partners, Marketing, technical teams, and Sales leadership. You&#39;ll use value-based selling and structured methodologies such as MEDDPICC and Command of the Message to build a healthy pipeline, forecast accurately, and support revenue goals across a wide range of deal sizes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role will be 100% remote and will be based in Mexico.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage a broad small and medium-sized business and mid-market book of business in Southern Cone, driving new and expansion opportunities from prospecting through close and renewal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on customer accounts with up to 1,999 team members, navigating a range of project sizes and complexity within the small and medium-sized business and mid-market segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate the value of GitLab&#39;s AI-powered DevSecOps platform, tailoring your approach to each customer&#39;s business and technical needs to support clear, outcome-focused decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a healthy pipeline through consistent outbound prospecting, qualification, and opportunity advancement, using structured methodologies such as MEDDPICC and Command of the Message.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document buying criteria, decision processes, next steps, and key stakeholders to run disciplined sales cycles and support accurate territory and forecast management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales Development, Customer Success, Renewals, Marketing, technical teams, and Partners to coordinate account strategies, co-sell, and deliver a cohesive pre- and post-sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customer adoption of GitLab solutions, proactively work to reduce churn and contraction, and participate in quarterly forecasting and territory planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share win and loss insights, update the sales handbook, and serve as a clear voice of the customer through GitLab&#39;s public issue tracker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Spanish and experience selling software as a service (SaaS) solutions through value-based conversations with technical and business stakeholders, ideally including development or DevSecOps teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning and managing a broad small and medium-sized business and mid-market territory as the primary point of contact, from prospecting through close, adoption, and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skill in building and maintaining strong customer relationships, including discovery, negotiation, and closing in support of long-term customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort driving consistent outbound prospecting, creating and maintaining a healthy pipeline, and keeping territory and forecast documentation accurate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to collaborate with Sales Development, Customer Success, Renewals, Marketing, Partners, and technical teams to coordinate and carry out account strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and structured communication skills, including presenting GitLab&#39;s DevSecOps value proposition to different audiences and documenting customer insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in GitLab, open source, and tools that support software development, with the ability to connect customer business challenges to GitLab&#39;s AI-powered DevSecOps platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel to meet customers and attend events as needed. We welcome transferable sales experience from a variety of backgrounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;About the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits within GitLab&#39;s broader Sales organization, focused on helping small and medium-sized business and mid-market customers adopt and expand their use of our AI-powered DevSecOps platform. You&#39;ll work with a distributed group across account management, Sales Development, Customer Success, Renewals, Marketing, Partners, and technical teams. Together, the team collaborates asynchronously across regions to manage a broad book of business and a wide range of opportunity sizes. The team guides customers from initial evaluation through long-term value by developing new business, strengthening customer relationships, and supporting healthy product adoption. You&#39;ll use shared playbooks, the sales handbook, and GitLab itself to stay coordinated on territory plans, pipeline health, and best practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Emplifi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://emplifi.io/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Emplifi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; is the only&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://emplifi.io/platform-overview/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; Autonomous CX platform&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; unifying social marketing, commerce, and customer care for more than 20,000 brands worldwide. Powered by Fuel AI, built on more than 5T of data, and recognized as a leader by leading industry analysts, Emplifi helps enterprise teams orchestrate connected customer journeys and deliver personalized experiences at scale, turning every customer touchpoint into a competitive advantage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Emplifi&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://emplifi.io/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Emplifi&lt;/a&gt; is the only &lt;a href=&quot;https://emplifi.io/platform-overview/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Autonomous CX platform&lt;/a&gt; unifying social marketing, commerce, and customer care for more than 20,000 brands worldwide. Powered by Fuel AI, built on more than 5T of data, and recognized as a leader by leading industry analysts, Emplifi helps enterprise teams orchestrate connected customer journeys and deliver personalized experiences at scale, turning every customer touchpoint into a competitive advantage.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Product Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Emplifi, our mission is to transform how digital marketing—especially on social—is done, and how consumers connect with brands in the 21st century.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Product team sits at the heart of this mission. We build and evolve a data-driven SaaS platform that helps global enterprises market smarter. By bridging customer needs, business goals, and technical innovation, we break down silos, foster collaboration, and use insights to guide smart, impactful decisions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced, data-driven &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to shape the future of Emplifi’s Data Insights capabilities — a core product area that enables brands to understand conversations, uncover emerging topics, and act on market signals that matter most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is about building intelligence that helps brands understand what people care about, how perceptions evolve, and where opportunities arise across digital channels. You’ll be leading a product area that helps marketers and strategists collect the right data and turn them into actionable insight—at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own the roadmap, vision, and execution for this strategic capability, partnering closely with design, engineering, data science, and go-to-market teams to create powerful, intuitive experiences for enterprise users. This includes managing integrations with external data providers to ensure scalable, high-quality access to insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is remote/hybrid from within the Czech Republic, the UK, France, or Germany.&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In today’s world, tracking discourse, sentiment, and context across digital sources gives brands a competitive edge. Organizations that move fast to uncover trends, surface risks, and respond to emergent feedback win. You’ll lead a product at the intersection of data, AI, and strategy helping the world’s leading brands stay in tune with conversations, perceptions, and signals that shape their markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is passionate about turning complex, unstructured data into clear insight and action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands how enterprise marketers, analysts, and strategists use insights to guide decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can translate business challenges into scalable, data-driven solutions powered by AI and analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a space where technology, storytelling, and customer empathy meet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do Here&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the vision and roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; for one of the Data Insights product line — setting direction based on customer needs, market dynamics, and company goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive product discovery&lt;/strong&gt; - talking to customers (brands and retailers), observing behavior, synthesizing data, and identifying unmet needs and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate ideas into execution&lt;/strong&gt; - write clear requirements, work with design and engineering, and iterate fast to deliver impactful, high-quality solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a market expert&lt;/strong&gt; - understand the competitive landscape and adjacent categories, monitor trends in ecommerce and AI, and translate them into product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage data partnerships and integrations &lt;/strong&gt;- oversee connections with third-party data providers and APIs, ensuring consistent, reliable data access. Evaluate vendor performance, react quickly to API or data schema changes, and balance product impact against integration costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner cross-functionally&lt;/strong&gt; - collaborate with Sales, Customer Success, Marketing, and Leadership to position the product for success across the customer lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure what matters&lt;/strong&gt; - define success metrics, analyze outcomes, and refine based on learnings to ensure continuous improvement and customer value.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Bring to Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years of experience in Product Management, &lt;/strong&gt;ideally in B2B SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Track record of product impact&lt;/strong&gt; – You’ve successfully led products through key stages of their lifecycle, whether taking over complex existing solutions or driving new launches, and can demonstrate how you improved outcomes and measured results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep familiarity with AI in practice&lt;/strong&gt; — you actively use AI tools to enhance your workflow and have experience defining, delivering, and iterating on AI-powered features that create tangible value for users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High autonomy &amp;amp; maturity&lt;/strong&gt; – You’re ready to own a product stream within your first 90 days, defining strategy, uncovering new problems, and driving delivery without hand-holding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global mindset&lt;/strong&gt; – Comfortable collaborating with colleagues and customers across time zones and cultures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile mindset&lt;/strong&gt; – Experienced in iterative releases, and data-driven optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical fluency &amp;amp; AI awareness&lt;/strong&gt; – You can talk architecture with engineers, understand how complex distributed systems fit together, and spot opportunities to apply the latest AI/ML advances to solve customer problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent, persuasive communicator&lt;/strong&gt; – You write, present, and negotiate confidently in English while actively listening, distilling insights, persuading stakeholders, and selling product value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive problem-solver&lt;/strong&gt; – You spot issues, rally the right people, and deliver solutions. No waiting for task lists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;BONUS POINTS&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with managing products that rely on external or third-party data sources. Comfortable analyzing ROI, negotiating data costs, and adapting quickly to changes in API availability or pricing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with analytics, data visualization, or insight-generation tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in social media, audience research, or digital strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for empowering organizations to make smarter, faster, data-driven decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Offer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International and fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chance to work with the world’s biggest brands at the CX tech leader&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sick Days &amp;amp; Community Service Days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multisport card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maternity and Parental Benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile and open-minded culture, with high levels of trust and flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity for professional growth and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possibility to learn new and cutting-edge technologies, in an environment that encourages new ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-first workplace, with access to leading AI tools (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, and more), empowering you to work smarter, innovate faster, and build AI skills for the future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in an international environment in our modern offices in Karlín, with our big terrace and our own grill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;There’s more as well! Speak with us to find out all the details!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Emplifi, we are committed to creating a workplace where everyone is valued, respected, and empowered to bring their whole selves to work. We welcome applications from individuals of all ages, races, religions, genders, sexual orientations, gender identities, and LGBTQ+ communities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Emplifi offers a safe, inclusive, and supportive environment where every employee has the opportunity to thrive and is encouraged to be who they are.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We welcome and encourage applicants with disabilities. Accommodations are available upon request at any stage of the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Emplifi, we are committed to creating a workplace where everyone is valued, respected, and empowered to bring their whole selves to work. We welcome applications from individuals of all ages, races, religions, genders, sexual orientations, gender identities, and LGBTQ+ communities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Emplifi offers a safe, inclusive, and supportive environment where every employee has the opportunity to thrive and is encouraged to be who they are.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;We welcome and encourage applicants with disabilities. Accommodations are available upon request at any stage of the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve has created a more efficient and privacy-focused way to buy and monetize advertising. Verve is an ecosystem of demand and supply technologies fusing data, media, and technology together to deliver results and growth to both advertisers and publishers–no matter the screen or location, no matter who, what, or where a customer is. With 30 offices across the globe and with an eye on servicing forward-thinking advertising customers, Verve’s solutions are trusted by more than 90 of the United States’ top 100 advertisers, 4,000 publishers globally, and the world’s top demand-side platforms. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/&quot;&gt;verve.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead hiring for a wide range of roles, with a focus on industry-specific roles such as Commercial (Sales, Account Management, Operations), Marketing, Product, and other Corporate/Support functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute proactive sourcing strategies with a focus on Germany, with some international exposure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with hiring managers and regional leaders to align hiring plans with business goals and challenges, acting as a trusted advisor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end recruitment: job scoping, sourcing, assessment, interview processes, and offers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver an exceptional candidate experience that reflects the company&#39;s culture and values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate on employer branding initiatives to position the company as an employer of choice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support improvements to recruitment processes, driving innovation and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help reduce agency reliance and optimize time-to-hire&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain ATS accuracy and deliver regular recruitment reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What You Will Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid recruitment experience, either from a recruitment agency or in-house, working with niche roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in sourcing, networking, interviewing, and offer negotiation at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent English and German communication skills are must have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in commercial roles and the advertising industry is highly desirable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical recruitment experience is nice to have&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced, high-growth, and rapidly changing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with (or willingness to get involved in) organizing meet-ups, recruitment events, and other innovative ways of attracting the best talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for telling the company story, building our brand, and establishing new processes that challenge traditional recruitment methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First-class interpersonal skills, with a client service-oriented mindset and acute attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interact with all levels of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, with a love for working collaboratively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tenacity and resilience to ride the sometimes unpredictable recruitment rollercoaster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Just a few of the benefits waiting for you at Verve:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your long-term financial security with our &lt;strong&gt;Allianz&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Corporate Pension Scheme&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pick what matters most to you in our &lt;strong&gt;Personalized Benefits Platform&lt;/strong&gt;, with a budget of €100/month: mobility support (BVG/HVV), internet allowance, daycare subsidy, &lt;strong&gt;Urban Sports Club&lt;/strong&gt; membership, personal development, and shopping vouchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your mental well-being with our&lt;strong&gt; Nilo Health Workplace Mental Health Solution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boost your professional knowledge with our annual&lt;strong&gt; training budget &amp;amp; internal webinars,&lt;/strong&gt; and level up your language skills through our &lt;strong&gt;German/English classes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with &lt;strong&gt;27 paid vacation days + 3 Wellness days&lt;/strong&gt; throughout the year, in addition to the public holidays&lt;br&gt;… and even more reasons to join us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot; href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Migration Engineer for GitLab Dedicated, you&#39;ll partner with customers to plan and deliver migrations from self-managed GitLab to GitLab Dedicated. You&#39;ll use GitLab Geo to replicate customer data and move customers onto fully managed, isolated GitLab environments with minimal disruption. You&#39;ll balance hands-on technical delivery with clear communication and project ownership, translating each customer&#39;s goals, timelines, and constraints into a practical plan and guiding them through cutover and validation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll use infrastructure as code and configuration as code practices, Kubernetes, cloud platforms, and network design to work within existing GitLab Dedicated environments. You&#39;ll also improve the tooling, scripts, and runbooks that make migrations repeatable and reduce manual work, while sharing insights from customer engagements with GitLab&#39;s Product and Engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead migrations from self-managed GitLab to GitLab Dedicated using GitLab Geo to replicate customer data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design migration runbooks and automation for repeatable cutovers, and validate target environments built with Terraform, Ansible, and Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver customer migrations from initial assessment through planning, replication, cutover, and post-migration validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use GitLab Geo to replicate customer data, debug synchronization issues, identify root causes, and keep migrations on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design customer network connectivity within GitLab Dedicated constraints, including virtual private clouds, private connectivity, Domain Name System configuration, and firewall rules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply infrastructure as code and configuration as code practices to interact with and validate existing GitLab Dedicated environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise customers on migration sequencing, cutover windows, integration requirements, risks, and clear next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve migration tooling, scripts, and runbooks to make delivery more reliable, repeatable, and efficient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Professional Services, Environment Automation, Product, and Engineering to resolve blockers, share field feedback, and keep delivery consistent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple customer engagements while balancing customer outcomes, delivery priorities, and share technical knowledge with other engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering customer-facing migration, installation, training, or technical advisory engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using, deploying, or configuring GitLab, with a solid understanding of Git and source control workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure as code or configuration as code tools such as Terraform, Ansible, Packer, Puppet, or Chef.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience running Kubernetes workloads in production, including deployments, rollouts, and debugging crash loops, failed health checks, and scheduling issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a major cloud provider such as Amazon Web Services (AWS), Google Cloud Platform (GCP), or Microsoft Azure, along with working knowledge of network design and connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read, understand, and modify infrastructure tooling, with familiarity in languages such as Go, Python, or Ruby.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to independently lead multiple customer projects, communicate clearly in written and spoken English, and build agreement in a remote, largely asynchronous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PubSec/Federal experience a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solution-oriented approach, effective cross-functional collaboration, and a commitment to GitLab&#39;s values. Experience with GitLab Geo and replication is helpful, but deep expertise can be developed in the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Migration Engineers are part of GitLab&#39;s Dedicated Infrastructure organization. We work with Sales, Professional Services, Environment Automation, Product, and Engineering to coordinate delivery, resolve customer needs, and share field feedback that improves GitLab features and delivery practices. We work remotely and largely asynchronously across regions and time zones, with a focus on reliable delivery and long-term customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
